/-!
# The fundamental identity over a Dedekind base

This file proves the fundamental identity `∑ e(w | v) f(w | v) = [F' : F]` for the places `w` of a
finite separable extension `F'` lying over a place `v` of `F`, where the places over `v` are
described through the integral closure of the valuation ring of `v`.

## Main statement

* `AlgebraicCurve.Place.sum_ramificationIndex_mul_inertiaDeg_fiberOver`
-/

namespace CurveGenus.FundamentalIdentityFiber

noncomputable section

